From f7a5488d0debc74a086e64b52d78522805a12892 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 22:47:08 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Connect and disconnect a block of ordinary V2 transactions.

Apply ordered ordinary transactions through the existing validator and
incremental UTXO view, sum invocation cost, and roll the block back when
the sum exceeds the profile cap. Disconnect restores the prior UTXO root
and monetary record. This is a standalone model, not lotusd ConnectTip.
